  "description": "Codex: Adeptus Custodes (11e) Emissaries Imperatus — HERALDS OF THE THRONE (WP-C46): friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES units have Fights First. Fixture cus11e_c3_custodes_active (no unit charged this turn); setup: P1 detachment Emissaries Imperatus, then the Fight phase is entered fresh so the FightSequencer starts from the new detachment, CP 0 for both, auto wound allocation. After both Pile In halves, the Fight step opens in the FIGHTS FIRST step and the panel offers the Custodes Blade Champion there although it did not charge; the Orks' engaged units are not Fights First (they only fight in the remaining step). A real click fights with the Blade Champion in the Fights First step.",
